1
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:07,460
怎么盒子和盖子的数量不对应呢
How could we don't have the same number of containers and lids?

2
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,780
它们怎么会分开呢
Why would they ever get separated?

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,620
可能感情不和 也可能经济问题
Built-up resentment, money issues,

4
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:13,180
还可能跟年轻的盖子跑了
met a younger lid.

5
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,360
妈妈 我的科学作业哪去了
Mom, where's my science homework?

6
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:17,840
就在那边的桌子上
Uh, it's over there on the table.

7
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,640
艾丽克斯 宝贝 最近怎么样
So, Alex, honey, what's going on?

8
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,160
有啥新鲜事吗
Anything exciting?

9
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:22,460
没有
No.

10
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:25,008
-有喜欢的男孩吗 -没有
- Any boys? - No.

11
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,640
我觉得我和艾丽克斯之间
I'm feeling a little bit disconnected

12
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:28,060
有代沟了
from Alex right now.

13
00:00:28,071 --> 00:00:30,720
就在上周
Last week, I picked up her cellphone,

14
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:31,700
我错拿了她的手机
thinking it was mine.

15
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:34,220
无意中看到几条暧昧短信
And I accidentally read a few flirty text messages

16
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,080
如果是她班上的某个男生干的
that were probably from a boy in her class,

17
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:37,040
那也就罢了
which is fine.

18
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:38,720
就怕是哪个混混发的
Or they're from a drifter.

19
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:40,360
来嘛 你就真没啥
Come on, isn't there something

20
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,380
要告诉你"马马"的吗
you want to share with your mommers?

21
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:44,340
有 别自称"马马"
Yeah. Don't call yourself "Mommers."

22
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:52,420
盒子想上盖子 盖子爆发了
He blew his lid when she tried to contain him.

23
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:13,580
你觉得这件怎么样
Okay. What do you think?

24
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:15,480
-我喜欢 -但不是特别喜欢
-I like it. -But you don't love it.

25
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:16,700
谁说的 我爱死它了
No, I do. I love it.

26
00:01:16,738 --> 00:01:19,400
-和刚才那件比 -天
- As much as you loved the other one? - Ooh.

27
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:22,911
好吧
Okay. Mm.

28
00:01:22,940 --> 00:01:26,320
房子着火了 我只来得及拿一件衬衫
The house is on fire. I only have time to grab one shirt.

29
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:27,540
我选谁
Which one do I take?

30
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:29,480
带上莉莉才是正解
The correct answer is take Lily.

31
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:30,820
那之后呢
After that.

32
00:01:30,847 --> 00:01:31,944
好吧 拿蓝色的那件
Uh, okay, the blue one.

33
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:33,380
因为我穿灰色的显胖
Because the gray one washes me out.

34
00:01:33,424 --> 00:01:35,350
不不不 别误会 小卡
No, no. Cam, you -- you can't go wrong here.

35
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:36,660
你不管穿什么都美翻了
Everything you've tried on looks great.

36
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:37,820
两件都好搭你
I love you in both of them.

37
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:39,540
还是你疼我
Oh, you're so nice to me.

38
00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:47,960
米奇尔不喜欢在公众场合亲热
Mitchell has a problem with public displays of affection.

39
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:50,560
我记得有一年的新年派对上
Um, I remember once at a new year's eve party,

40
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:53,060
零点钟声一响 他和我击掌庆祝
stroke of midnight, he high-fived me.

41
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,840
两个问题
Two problems with that --

42
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:57,180
首先 同志不击掌
One, gays don't high-five.

43
00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:59,840
其次 同志不击掌
Two, gays don't high-five.

44
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:02,100
我回来啦
I'm home!

45
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:05,340
烧什么呢这么香
Mmm, what smells so good?

46
00:02:05,340 --> 00:02:08,249
我在做圈圈肉 哥伦比亚名菜呢
I'm making chunchullo, a traditional Colombian dish,

47
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,780
为了今晚的家庭聚餐准备的
for dinner with the family tonight.

48
00:02:09,780 --> 00:02:11,064
圈圈肉
Chunchullo.

49
00:02:11,064 --> 00:02:12,840
那是啥 跟玉米卷差不多吗
What is that -- like, uh, tacos?

50
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:14,400
对 就跟玉米卷似的
Yes, like tacos.

51
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,451
才不是呢
No, it isn't.

52
00:02:15,451 --> 00:02:17,820
-这是猪肠做的 -我的老天爷
- It's the small intestine of a pig. - Oh, Geez.

53
00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:20,580
我们就不能像其他人一样吃正常点儿吗
Why can't we eat regular food like normal people?

54
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:21,760
我跟你说过滴 杰
I told you, Jay.

55
00:02:21,760 --> 00:02:24,200
我那远在天国的奶奶
My grandmother, who rests in peace,

56
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:26,240
曾经托梦给我
has been coming to me in my dreams,

57
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:29,060
告诫我不要忘本
telling me that I'm losing touch with my roots.

58
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,460
你看 这下尴尬了
See, this is awkward,

59
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:32,940
因为我死了的叔叔告诉我今晚该吃牛排
because my dead uncle joe told me to have steak tonight.

60
00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:34,880
不不不 杰 放尊重点
No, no, no, Jay. Have some respect.

61
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:37,420
我奶奶能听见你滴
My grandmother can hear you.

62
00:02:38,020 --> 00:02:39,460
什么意思 她能听到我们吗
What do you mean, she can hear us?

63
00:02:39,580 --> 00:02:40,960
是这样滴 在我们的文化里
Well, in our culture,

64
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:42,900
我们相信死者的灵魂就在我们身边
we believe that the dead are all around us.

65
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:43,680
她说的对 曼尼
She's right, Manny.

66
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,340
可能现在她就在你背后
She could be right here,

67
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:47,820
从坟墓里伸出她那瘦骨嶙峋的手指
her bony fingers reaching out from the grave.

68
00:02:49,220 --> 00:02:50,660
厉害哦 杰 继续忽悠呀
Yeah, keep it up, Jay.

69
00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:52,840
这房子里已经有一个死人了
There's already one dead person in this room.

70
00:02:52,866 --> 00:02:53,967
你也想死是哇
You want to make it two?

71
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,060
我错了 我去装打印机
I'm sorry. I've got a printer to install.

72
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,280
歌洛莉亚 麻烦让你奶奶
Oh, Gloria, have your grandmother

73
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:00,000
十分钟后给我拿杯冰红茶来
run me up an iced tea in about 10 minutes.

74
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:02,680
是啊 她要活着滴话干得比你好
Yeah, she has a better chance of making that work than you!

75
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:05,960
你打电话给菲尔啊 省得一会你搞砸了又叫又骂
Why don't you save us the stomping and the swearing and call Phil?

76
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,060
他这方面比较牛
He's good at that stuff.

77
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:07,760
能有我牛
Better than me?

78
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:09,580
菲尔任何方面都没我牛
Phil's not better than me at anything,

79
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:12,560
他也就只会怪叫啥的
Except maybe making that stupid sound with his mouth.

80
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:19,840
咋 咋样
A what, what

81
00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:21,952
你口水喷我脸上了
You spit on me.

82
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:25,440
宝贝海莉 来帮我个忙
Haley, honey, um, I need you to do something for me.

83
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:27,340
啊 妈 我手痛
Ugh. Mom, my arm hurts.

84
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:28,780
你都不知道我找你啥事
Why don't you find out what it is

85
00:03:28,780 --> 00:03:30,940
着急编瞎话干嘛
before you start making up excuses to get out of it?

86
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,440
好吧 说吧
Okay, what is it?

87
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:34,420
我要你去和你妹妹谈谈
I need you to talk to your sister.

88
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:37,460
我觉得她和某个男孩子有暧昧
I think that there's something going on with her and a boy.

89
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:38,320
然后
So?

90
00:03:38,980 --> 00:03:41,640
然后 我是你们的妈妈
So, I am your mother, and it is my job to make sure

91
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:43,360
确保你们不被坏蛋给剥皮吃了
that you girls don't get involved with a predator.

92
00:03:43,740 --> 00:03:45,380
得了吧 妈妈 别再看新闻联播了
Okay, mom, stop watching "Dateline."

93
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:47,060
你自己怎么不去和她谈
And why can't you just talk to her?

94
00:03:47,060 --> 00:03:48,880
我试过了
I have tried to talk to her.

95
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:51,300
她不会跟我开口的 你懂的
I -- she won't talk to me. You know that.

96
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:54,380
因为一有男孩接近我们你就变得神经质
That's because you get so weird every time a boy comes near us.

97
00:03:54,423 --> 00:03:56,100
我只是不想你们这些女孩子
I-I just don't want you girls to --

98
00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:58,480
-重蹈你的覆辙吗 -不是
- To make the same mistakes that you did? - No!

99
00:03:59,620 --> 00:04:00,020
当然不是
No.

100
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:01,880
老妈 我又不傻
Mom, I'm not an idiot.

101
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,260
我看得出来
I pick up on things.

102
00:04:03,260 --> 00:04:05,260
你可不是你口中描述的
And I don't think that you were the good girl

103
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:06,200
那种好女孩
you pretend you were.

104
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:08,600
天哪 你大错特错了
Wow. That is so untrue.

105
00:04:08,628 --> 00:04:10,681
你不知道我以前有多乖
I was a very good girl. Mm.

106
00:04:10,820 --> 00:04:12,200
孩子不需要知道
Your kids don't need to know

107
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:15,420
他们只需了解你想要的完美形象
They need to know who you wish you were,

108
00:04:15,420 --> 00:04:17,640
还必须以你为榜样
and they need to try to live up to that person.

109
00:04:18,220 --> 00:04:19,460
他们可能达不到这个标准
They're gonna fall short,

110
00:04:19,460 --> 00:04:21,380
但参照人物是虚构的完美的你
but better they fall short of the fake you

111
00:04:21,380 --> 00:04:22,500
肯定比真实的你强
than the real you.

112
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,020
所以我们从不隐瞒
Which is why we don't hide anything.

113
00:04:24,020 --> 00:04:25,749
你说的和我的刚好相反
That's the opposite of what I just said.

114
00:04:25,749 --> 00:04:28,474
我溜号了
I was not listening.

115
00:04:30,965 --> 00:04:32,968
我还得说一遍 我喜欢你穿这件佩斯利
I'll say it again -- I love you in paisley.

116
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,580
不如先关好门 拉好窗帘
Oh, let me lock the door and draw the curtains.

117
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:35,680
你什么意思
What does that mean?

118
00:04:36,220 --> 00:04:38,100
-什么意思都没有 -很好
-It doesn't mean anything. -Good.

119
00:04:38,220 --> 00:04:39,440
你当然知道我什么意思
You know exactly what it means.

120
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,020
你不在别人面前亲我
You won't kiss me in front of other people

121
00:04:41,020 --> 00:04:42,620
是因为你不能正视自己
because you're ashamed of who you are.

122
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,620
没错 我就是戳你痛处了
And, yes...I went there.

123
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:46,300
你不能拿戳我当乐事
Okay, you can't say, "Yes, I went there,"

124
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:47,660
还企图用过去式
when you go there all the time.

125
00:04:48,140 --> 00:04:50,580
再说了 每次飞机上有人对咱们另眼相待
And, by the way, I'm the one who makes speeches on airplanes

126
00:04:50,580 --> 00:04:52,020
可都是我站出来教育他们
every time someone looks at us weird.

127
00:04:52,180 --> 00:04:53,620
我爸爸说你是我"朋友"的时候
I'm the one who gives my dad hell

128
00:04:53,654 --> 00:04:55,784
也是我跟他挑明挖烂了理论
when he refers to you as my "Friend."

129
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:57,340
那不一样 那是正面冲突
That's different. That's confrontation.

130
00:04:58,100 --> 00:04:59,240
但你知道什么才最需要勇气吗
But you know what takes real strength?

131
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,080
抱怨吗
Whining?

132
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,300
-是表达爱意 -受不了了
-Affection. -Oh, this is insane.

133
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:04,420
买衬衫有什么可亲的
Buying a shirt -- it's not a kiss-worthy moment.

134
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:06,260
我不知道这还有官方规定
Oh, I didn't know there was an official list.

135
00:05:06,300 --> 00:05:08,060
求你 告诉我 什么时候能亲
Please, tell us -- what is on the list?

136
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:09,360
我告诉你什么时候不亲吧
I'll tell you what's not on the list --

137
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:10,760
吃了夹辣椒的橄榄
Finding jalapeno-stuffed olives,

138
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:12,580
给枫树挂灯泡的时候
making the light on maple,

139
00:05:12,610 --> 00:05:14,589
看到大众车的时候也不亲
every time we see a V.W.

140
00:05:14,589 --> 00:05:15,400
你不喜欢玩"亲亲甲壳虫"[看到大众甲壳虫车就亲亲]
You don't like "Kiss-buggy"?

141
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:16,900
那根本就不是游戏
It's not a real game!

142
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,800
那不过是你黏人的一种方式
It -- it's just another way for you to be needy.

143
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:21,160
你可别想把我搞得很内疚
I -- and I don't appreciate you making me feel bad

144
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:23,260
因为我可达不到你那离谱的标准
because I can't live up to your impossible standards.

145
00:05:23,700 --> 00:05:25,200
没人在保龄球馆接吻
Nobody kisses at a bowling alley!

146
00:05:25,340 --> 00:05:27,500
我差点打出三击全中
I almost got a turkey!

147
00:05:38,297 --> 00:05:40,097
侬好
"Yello"?

148
00:05:40,700 --> 00:05:42,200
你好 杰 等下 我找克莱尔去
Oh, hey, Jay. Just a sec. I'll go get Claire.

149
00:05:42,226 --> 00:05:43,709
其实我找你
Oh, actually, it's you I'm calling.

150
00:05:44,540 --> 00:05:45,460
什么声音
What was that?

151
00:05:45,460 --> 00:05:48,040
是猫 有只猫 什么事
The cat. There's a cat. What's up?

152
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,520
歌洛莉亚很想念她的外婆
Well, Gloria's been missing her grandmother.

153
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,720
我一直想打印出一张她的照片
I've been trying to get this old picture of her printed,

154
00:05:51,740 --> 00:05:53,520
但是新的打印机 我...
but I can't get this new printer to --

155
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:54,380
我马上到
I'll be right there.

156
00:05:54,853 --> 00:05:56,700
卢克 外公需要我们
Luke, grandpa needs us!

157
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:58,480
接到电话 我当然很高兴
Hells yes, I was glad to get the call.

158
00:05:58,660 --> 00:06:00,420
杰总来我家修东西
Jay's always around here fixing things,

159
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,240
嘲笑我柔弱的双手
cracking jokes about my "Delicate hands"

160
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:05,327
还有我一闻油漆就吐
or my gag response to the smell of paint.

161
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,780
看看谁来求哥了
Look who needs me now

162
00:06:07,780 --> 00:06:10,220
"手好粗"先生每次想按打印键
Mr. Hot-dog fingers who can't press "Print"

163
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:11,760
他那胖手都会多按好几个按钮
without hitting three extra keys.

164
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:13,600
真菜
Yeah!

165
00:06:14,157 --> 00:06:16,773
你可是在我的主场 杰
You're in my house now, Jay!

166
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:19,161
准确的说 我要去他的地盘迎战
T-technically, we'll be in his house,

167
00:06:19,201 --> 00:06:21,220
但是他的地盘
but we'll be in my area...

168
00:06:21,220 --> 00:06:22,660
哥做主
of his house.

169
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,400
我听说你有男朋友了
So, I hear you have a boyfriend.

170
00:06:26,580 --> 00:06:27,860
-哪有 -他是谁
- No, I don't. - Who is he?

171
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,960
-我才不告诉你呢 -说吧
- I'm not talking to you about this. - Oh, come on.

172
00:06:29,960 --> 00:06:32,000
你总算有点八卦可挖了 快说呗
You're finally interesting. Just tell me.

173
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:33,660
他不是我男友
He's not my boyfriend.

174
00:06:34,420 --> 00:06:35,320
他叫杰里米·瑞德
It's Jeremy Reed.

175
00:06:35,357 --> 00:06:37,720
不过是个男孩 我...
It's -- he's just this boy that I --

176
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:38,860
-爱他 -没有
- Love? - No!

177
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:40,420
你们接吻了吗
Well, have you guys kissed yet?

178
00:06:40,580 --> 00:06:41,020
没有
No!

179
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,520
那你等什么呢
Well, what are you waiting for?

180
00:06:42,660 --> 00:06:44,580
我没等 人家才13岁
I'm not waiting. I'm 13.

181
00:06:44,580 --> 00:06:46,640
你还没亲过男生
And you've never kiss boy?

182
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:47,660
你初吻什么时候
How old were you?

183
00:06:47,980 --> 00:06:48,900
11岁的时候吧
Like 11.

184
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:50,420
唯美极了
And it was beautiful.

185
00:06:50,576 --> 00:06:54,532
是在杰克逊·肯纳家铺了地毯的车库里
I was in Jackson Kaner's carpeted garage.

186
00:06:54,580 --> 00:06:55,700
-11岁 -是啊
- 11? - Yeah.

187
00:06:55,700 --> 00:06:56,780
你最好也抓紧
So you better get on it,

188
00:06:56,780 --> 00:06:58,260
要不然他会觉得你是拉拉
or else he's gonna think you're a lesbian.

189
00:06:58,420 --> 00:07:00,000
他才不会认为我是拉拉
He's not going to think I'm a lesbian.

190
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,180
我就以为你是
I thought you were.

191
00:07:01,260 --> 00:07:03,140
你那凉鞋很拉拉
You totally have the sandals for it.

192
00:07:05,060 --> 00:07:06,840
我们来看看出了什么问题
Let's see this bad boy.

193
00:07:06,876 --> 00:07:10,294
P-750型 不错
Oh, a P-750. Nice unit.

194
00:07:10,580 --> 00:07:11,980
要是我 会选840那款
I would have sprung for the 840,

195
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:12,640
但是我知道
But I get it --

196
00:07:12,660 --> 00:07:14,380
不是谁都能玩转这种高级货的
not everyone can handle that kind of horsepower.

197
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:16,560
我以为是无线电话干扰了信号
I thought maybe the cordless phone was interfering,

198
00:07:16,780 --> 00:07:17,600
我就给它拔了
so I unplugged it.

199
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,200
好主意 也许我们应该下楼
Good idea. Maybe we should run downstairs

200
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:20,920
把面包机也拔了
and unplug the toaster while we're at it.

201
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:22,700
幽默啊 老爸
Oh, snap, dad.

202
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:23,580
面包机
Toaster.

203
00:07:24,580 --> 00:07:25,340
开玩笑
We're kidding.

204
00:07:25,340 --> 00:07:28,200
无线电话是5.8千兆赫 这个是无线网络
A cordless phone is 5.8 gigahertz. This is wi-fi.

205
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:29,480
用的不是一个频谱
It's a totally different spectrum.

206
00:07:30,100 --> 00:07:30,860
跟我来
Walk with me?

207
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:35,260
教克莱尔使用电器的时候 我发明了个小诀窍
Here's a little trick that I've found pretty useful with Claire.

208
00:07:36,980 --> 00:07:40,460
电脑和打印机必须要交流 流 流
The computer and the printer must talk, talk, talk

209
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:45,400
command+p[苹果快捷键] 图片就出来了 了 了
command-p" Makes the picture walk, walk, walk"

210
00:07:47,380 --> 00:07:48,780
好像没反应啊
How come it's not working?

211
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:50,100
不应该啊
It should be.

212
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:51,520
好吧
Okay.

213
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:54,070
应该开始打印了
Uh, that should be printing.

214
00:07:54,100 --> 00:07:55,460
应该是...
So...

215
00:07:55,460 --> 00:07:57,780
菲尔 在打的你头头头之前
Hey, Phil, I'm gonna get a beer, beer, beer

216
00:07:57,780 --> 00:07:59,280
我要先喝杯啤酒酒酒
Before I hit you in the head, head, head.

217
00:08:07,340 --> 00:08:08,960
嘿 有事吗
Hey. What are you doing here?

218
00:08:09,100 --> 00:08:10,920
杰里米 我有问题想问你
Hi, Jeremy. I want to ask you something.

219
00:08:10,950 --> 00:08:13,178
-好 问 -等等 你先别出声
- Sure, ask - Wait, don't talk yet.

220
00:08:13,178 --> 00:08:13,900
是在这么回事
Here is the thing.

221
00:08:13,900 --> 00:08:16,220
我们短信已经发了一段时间了 这样挺好
We've texting for a while, and it's been nice,

222
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,300
但我感觉我们不止于此
but I feel like it's leading to something else,

223
00:08:18,300 --> 00:08:20,020
我不知道你有没有这种感觉
and I don't know if you do or not,

224
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:21,960
我要说的是
but I guess what I'm trying to say is,

225
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:24,820
我只是一个女孩 站在一个男孩面前
I'm just a girl standing in front of a boy

226
00:08:24,820 --> 00:08:27,020
请他喜欢她
asking for him to like her.

227
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:29,680
不对 这句是《诺丁山》的台词
Oh, god, that's from "Notting hill."

228
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:32,063
太老套了 不过这绝对是部被低估的电影
So dorky. But a really underrated movie.

229
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,380
你想表达什么
What's happening?

230
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:34,780
我不是拉拉
I'm not a lesbian.

231
00:08:35,540 --> 00:08:37,080
我想你亲我
I would like for you to kiss me.

232
00:08:55,747 --> 00:08:58,046
我喜欢看你搅拌的样子
Oh, I love watching you stir.

233
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:58,920
那我就停下
Then I will stop.

234
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,660
怎么 你还生我的气
What? Are you still mad at me?

235
00:09:01,260 --> 00:09:05,180
是 你要为取笑我滴文化 我滴信仰
Yes. You have to apologize for making fun of my culture, my beliefs,

236
00:09:05,180 --> 00:09:07,294
我滴圈圈肉 我滴奶奶而道歉
my chunchullo, my abuela.

237
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:07,980
对不起
I'm sorry.

238
00:09:08,620 --> 00:09:10,560
如果你认为你奶奶也在这里
If you think your Grandmother's here with us,

239
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:11,340
我表示尊重
I respect that.

240
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:12,580
来抱抱
Now, come here.

241
00:09:13,220 --> 00:09:15,420
奶奶 你从哪冒出来的
Oh, Grandma! Where'd you come from?

242
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,860
看来我们要给你系个小铃铛才行
We're gonna have to get you a little bell.

243
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:19,960
够了 杰
Enough, Jay!

244
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:22,220
我的文化对我很重要
My culture is very important to me!

245
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:25,300
为了今晚跟你滴家人吃饭我忙了一整天
I've been working all day to share it with your family tonight,

246
00:09:25,300 --> 00:09:26,960
你却只管嘲笑我
and all you do is mock me!

247
00:09:26,980 --> 00:09:27,640
走开
Just go!

248
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,140
亲爱的 对不起
Honey, I'm sorry.

249
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:30,600
我只是逗你玩
I'm just teasing you.

250
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:33,220
有时间当小丑 干嘛不帮我
Instead of being the comedian, why don't you help me?

251
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:34,780
要我干什么
What do you need?

252
00:09:36,580 --> 00:09:37,940
-拍鸡肉 -干什么
- Slap the chicken. - Do what?

253
00:09:38,220 --> 00:09:41,560
在哥伦比亚 为了表示对死者的尊重
In Colombia, when you cook in honor of the departed,

254
00:09:41,900 --> 00:09:44,560
烹饪前要把死神从食物吓走
you have to scare death away from the food

255
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:46,800
以保护将要吃此食物滴人
to protect the people that are gonna eat it.

256
00:09:46,860 --> 00:09:48,040
一边拍一边叫
Slap it and yell.

257
00:09:48,095 --> 00:09:49,900
那也太傻缺了
That's the nuttiest --

258
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:51,360
-杰 -淡定
-Jay! -Calm down.

259
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:52,520
鸡肉拿来
Give me the chicken.

260
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:54,800
拍就拍
Here we go.

261
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:59,820
介么轻什么也吓不跑
That's not scaring anything away.

262
00:09:59,980 --> 00:10:01,680
以前我爷爷做饭滴时候
When my grandfather used to cook,

263
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:03,800
整间房子都在颤抖
the whole house would shake.

264
00:10:07,380 --> 00:10:08,020
大声点
Louder.

265
00:10:10,540 --> 00:10:11,180
调高点
Higher.

266
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:14,100
不够大声
Louder!

267
00:10:14,100 --> 00:10:17,326
调再高 声再大 这才差不多
Higher! Louder! There!

268
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:19,020
我瞎编滴
I made all that up.

269
00:10:19,020 --> 00:10:20,971
哥伦比亚没有这个习俗
That is not a real custom in Colombia.

270
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:21,980
我们又不是精神错乱
We're not lunatics.

271
00:10:21,980 --> 00:10:25,000
但你惹姐不高兴 姐也不让你舒坦
But you mess with us, and we mess with you.

272
00:10:25,700 --> 00:10:27,160
这才素我们的习俗
That's the custom.

273
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:30,200
大声点
Louder!

274
00:10:34,180 --> 00:10:35,120
亲爱的 你去哪了
Hey, honey. Where'd you go?

275
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:36,580
哪也没去 就骑了会脚踏车
Nowhere. Just for a bike ride.

276
00:10:36,820 --> 00:10:39,100
我的天 求求你告诉我这短信纯属虚构
Oh, my god! Puh-lease tell me this text is wrong!

277
00:10:39,180 --> 00:10:41,260
你真跑去那个小屁孩的家
Did you really just go over to that kid's house

278
00:10:41,260 --> 00:10:43,780
在众目睽睽之下跟他索吻
and try and kiss him in front of a million people?!

279
00:10:43,823 --> 00:10:45,917
-艾丽克斯你真这么做了 -你收到短信爆料了
- Alex, did you do that? - You got a text?

280
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,740
当然 地球人都知道了
Oh, yeah. Everybody knows.

281
00:10:47,900 --> 00:10:50,020
你知道这让我有多尴尬吗
Do you know how embarrassing this is for me?!

282
00:10:50,020 --> 00:10:51,140
这都是你的错
This is all your fault!

283
00:10:51,140 --> 00:10:53,680
是你说我如果不跟他接吻就是拉拉
You're the one who said I had to kiss him or I was a lesbian!

284
00:10:53,725 --> 00:10:55,798
海莉 你真这么说了
Haley! Did you say that to her?!

285
00:10:55,820 --> 00:10:57,920
别扯到我身上 你看她穿的那双鞋
Oh, don't turn this on me. Look at her shoes!

286
00:10:58,060 --> 00:10:59,920
我永远都不要去上学了
Ugh! I'm never going back to school now.

287
00:10:59,980 --> 00:11:02,300
不 亲爱的 你要 你要去上学
No, sweetheart. Yes, you are. You are going back to school.

288
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:04,440
但听我说 男生给你发暧昧短信
But listen to me-- Just because a boy sends you flirty texts.

289
00:11:04,820 --> 00:11:05,600
并不表示
Doesn't mean that

290
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:07,080
-你要回复他 -什么 你偷看我短信
-you have to text him back - what?! You read my texts?!

291
00:11:07,128 --> 00:11:08,962
-我... -你偷看她短信
- I... - You read her texts?!

292
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,160
这就是为什么你要我跟她谈
That's why you made me talk to her?!

293
00:11:11,220 --> 00:11:12,560
是你让她跟我谈的
You made her talk to me?!

294
00:11:12,580 --> 00:11:14,740
我觉得我们现在把话题扯远了
I kind of feel like we're spinning out here a little bit.

295
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:17,080
艾丽克斯 重点是
Look, Alex, the important thing here

296
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:19,680
你跟男生的交往要格外小心
Is that you have to be very careful how you behave around boys

297
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:22,440
要不你很容易就把名声给毁了
Because it is so easy to get a reputation.

298
00:11:22,740 --> 00:11:25,340
我很抱歉我不像你是那么完美的乖乖女
Well, I'm sorry I'm not a perfect little good girl like you were!

299
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:28,920
你乖吗
Were you?

300
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:30,600
你乖吗?!
Were you?!

301
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,880
我严重怀疑
I highly doubt it!

302
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:37,860
胆子别这么小 这里根本没有什么鬼魂
Don't be such a chicken. There's no ghost in here.

303
00:11:37,980 --> 00:11:41,420
我说真的 我妈说她过世的奶奶就在这
I'm telling you, my Mom said her dead grander was in the house.

304
00:11:41,820 --> 00:11:43,620
她说她今天早上感觉到她的存在
She said she felt her here this morning...

305
00:11:43,620 --> 00:11:44,700
就在这个房间
In this room.

306
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,440
也许你妈精神病
Maybe your Mom's mentally ill.

307
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:57,785
是哪个天刹的把路由器... 放在阁楼里
Who puts a router... in the attic?

308
00:11:59,642 --> 00:12:03,277
她是不是腿脚不便 杵着一根枴杖
Did she have a limp and a cane?

309
00:12:12,260 --> 00:12:15,560
曼尼曾祖母的鬼魂
Ghost of Manny's great-grandma,

310
00:12:15,860 --> 00:12:18,760
如果真是你
if that's really you,

311
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:20,760
快快显灵
Show yourself!

312
00:12:25,660 --> 00:12:27,080
这就是我曾祖母
That's her!

313
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:35,420
怎么会
Come on!

314
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:37,540
为什么
Why?!

315
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:40,600
为什么?!!
Why?!!

316
00:12:44,420 --> 00:12:46,340
-外公好 -你们好吗 孩子们
-Hi, grandpa.- How we doing, girls?

317
00:12:46,420 --> 00:12:47,840
我今天算是被妈妈毁了
Mom ruined my life today.

318
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:49,860
-我没有 我是 -不要和我说话
-I didn't ruin your life. I was - don't even talk to me!

319
00:12:49,860 --> 00:12:51,280
我根本都不想来这
I didn't even want to come here.

320
00:12:52,760 --> 00:12:53,560
好了
Well, okay.

321
00:12:53,614 --> 00:12:55,380
点心和苏打水在客厅
Snacks and and sodas are in the living room,

322
00:12:55,380 --> 00:12:57,700
别吃太饱 一会还要吃猪肠
But don't fill up -- we've got intestines coming.

323
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:00,960
那个 爸 如果你在找鞋
Uh, dad, if you're looking for your shoes,

324
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:02,160
我晓得在哪儿
I think I know where they are.

325
00:13:02,220 --> 00:13:03,860
这是个哥伦比亚风俗
This happens to be a colombian custom --

326
00:13:03,920 --> 00:13:06,480
追随祖先的足迹啥啥啥的
Walking in the footsteps of the ancestors, blah, blah, blah.

327
00:13:06,620 --> 00:13:07,520
总比让我拍鸡肉好过
Beats slapping the chicken.

328
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,320
来 我给你拿了杯喝的
Here, I brought you a drink.

329
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:13,720
等一下
Oh, wait a minute --

330
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:15,500
你先喝一口
Sip it first.

331
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:17,200
我没生你气
I'm not mad at you.

332
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,720
我想了一下 也许你是对的
I thought about it, and maybe you're right.

333
00:13:19,740 --> 00:13:21,840
有时候我是有点粘人了
I can be a little needy sometimes.

334
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:24,307
喔 谢谢你那么说
Oh, well, I-I appreciate that.

335
00:13:24,340 --> 00:13:26,320
当然也不全是你的错
And you're probably not entirely off base.

336
00:13:26,351 --> 00:13:29,204
我是说 天知道 我自己也很怪咖
I mean, lord knows I-I've got my quirks.

337
00:13:29,245 --> 00:13:31,955
我不是个爱感情外露的人
And I-I'm not the most demonstrative guy around,

338
00:13:31,985 --> 00:13:34,880
但是我在改
But I'm -- I'm working on it.

339
00:13:34,880 --> 00:13:36,560
-我会帮你的 -好
-And I'm gonna help you with it. -Good.

340
00:13:36,980 --> 00:13:38,940
别失去耐心
Just don't give up on me.

341
00:13:39,060 --> 00:13:39,300
永远不会
Never.

342
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:42,820
大家伙都过来
Okay, everybody, let's gather around!

343
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:43,920
杰 过来
Jay, come here.

344
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:47,800
今晚我们吃传统哥伦比亚菜
Tonight we dine on the traditional colombian recipes

345
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:50,200
我奶奶的拿手菜 [abuela西班牙语里祖母的意思]
of my abuela, my grandmother.

346
00:13:50,620 --> 00:13:52,460
尽管她已经不在了
And even though she's no longer with me,

347
00:13:52,580 --> 00:13:55,580
但素我很高兴 因为我有你们
I am very happy because I have all of you.

348
00:13:56,791 --> 00:13:59,946
为了我的祖母干杯[祖母名字不要太~长]
To ana-maria rosa de la immaculada jimenez morales.

349
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:02,340
为… 那谁干杯
To ana-maria rosa...

350
00:14:04,551 --> 00:14:06,000
歌洛莉亚 太美好了
That was beautiful, Gloria,

351
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,160
就像我的米奇尔一样
just like my Mitchell.

352
00:14:12,392 --> 00:14:14,290
好滑
Just slipped right off there.

353
00:14:16,210 --> 00:14:18,626
卡梅隆 怎么了
Ay, Cameron, what happened?

354
00:14:18,660 --> 00:14:19,860
刚才你还坐在那
One moment you were there,

355
00:14:19,860 --> 00:14:21,301
一眨眼滴功夫就只看见鞋子了
the next, only shoes.

356
00:14:21,340 --> 00:14:21,960
我告诉你是怎么回事
I'll tell you what happened --

357
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,580
米奇尔不好意思
Mitchell is embarrassed to kiss me

358
00:14:23,580 --> 00:14:24,400
在别人面前吻我
in front of other people.

359
