I screamed the death out of your meat.

374
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:54,200
-你到底想让我怎么样 -看见了吧
-Now, what do you want from me? -Don't you see?

375
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,580
都是因为你
It's because of you

376
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:58,066
你儿子才不肯吻他情人的
that your son cannot kiss his own lover.

377
00:14:58,066 --> 00:15:00,267
-不要说"情人" -我们不喜欢说"情人"
- Don't say "Lover." - we don't like "Lover."

378
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:02,340
我们吃饭好不好
Can we just eat?

379
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,340
不行 你告诉米奇尔
No. Tell Mitch

380
