425
00:16:32,820 --> 00:16:35,440
"我很高兴你们大家都能来"
How about "I'm -- I'm so happy to be here for you all

426
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:38,040
"所以我才能在这享受你们的碎碎念"吗
so I can take the blame for all your crap."

427
